**Done this wake**
- Checked both runs at 0.46 epoch (12,800 of 28,032 rows). These are the "frozen" finetunes: only the decoder's LoRA adapter trains, while the compressor and the connector stay fixed. Held-out loss (lower is better) is a little below the reference finetune at the same point:

  | seed | frozen | reference | kill threshold |
  |---|---|---|---|
  | 42 | .444 | .455 | .513 |
